msgstr "捆绑连接器缺失或无效。请打开更新以修复或重新安装 NeoStack，然后再次检查设置。"

#. Key:	Connect21cac947b8
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,Connect21cac947b8"
msgid "NeoStack preserved your edited skill files. Review the upstream changes in Skills; setup will not overwrite your work."
msgstr "NeoStack 已保留你编辑的技能文件。请在“技能”中查看上游更改；设置不会覆盖你的工作。"

#. Key:	Connectd01a339efe
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,Connectd01a339efe"
msgid "Open this project in Codex and trust it if prompted, then restart or reload Codex and start a new chat. Project trust, sign-in and actual tool loading have not been verified. Other Codex settings may affect which server loads."
msgstr "在 Codex 中打开此项目，在提示时信任它，然后重启或重新加载 Codex 并开始新聊天。项目信任、登录和实际工具加载尚未验证。其他 Codex 设置可能影响加载哪个服务器。"

#. Key:	Connect59a26a0b65
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,Connect59a26a0b65"
msgid "Open this project folder as the Antigravity app workspace. Reload or reopen it, then check Settings > Customizations for NeoStack. Start a new chat and select neostack-hello; approve tools when prompted. Sign-in and tool loading have not been verified."
msgstr "将此项目文件夹作为 Antigravity 应用工作区打开。重新加载或重新打开，然后在 Settings > Customizations 中查看 NeoStack。开始新聊天并选择 neostack-hello；在提示时批准工具。登录和工具加载尚未验证。"

#. Key:	Connect90192b0f32
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,Connect90192b0f32"
msgid "Open this project folder in Antigravity CLI. Use /mcp to reload servers, then start a new chat and select neostack-hello. Approve tools when prompted. Sign-in, tool loading and other settings have not been verified."
msgstr "在 Antigravity CLI 中打开此项目文件夹。使用 /mcp 重新加载服务器，然后开始新聊天并选择 neostack-hello。在提示时批准工具。登录、工具加载和其他设置尚未验证。"

#. Key:	OpenTrustedProject
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,OpenTrustedProject"
msgid "Open this Git repository in {App}. Trust it if prompted, then reload and start a new session. Sign-in and tool loading are unverified."
msgstr "在 {App} 中打开此 Git 仓库。在提示时信任它，然后重新加载并开始新会话。登录和工具加载尚未验证。"

#. Key:	Connect90872823ac
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativeChatClientConnectSettings,Connect90872823ac"
msgid "Open Claude Code in this project and approve NeoStack when prompted. Claude's approval, sign-in and tool connection have not been verified."
msgstr "在此项目中打开 Claude Code，并在提示时批准 NeoStack。Claude 的批准、登录和工具连接尚未验证。"

