msgstr "通常由 NeoStack 管理。除 localhost 外必须使用 HTTPS。留空使用默认值。重启后生效。"

#. Key:	Setting4253f153d5
msgctxt "NeoStack.NativePluginSettingsStore,Setting4253f153d5"
msgid "Normally managed by NeoStack. An empty endpoint disables full-log uploads. Existing uploads keep their original destination."
msgstr "通常由 NeoStack 管理。端点为空会禁用完整日志上传。现有上传保持原来的目标地址。"

